  "description": "Steam OpenID 2.0 verification, Steam Web API reads and a daily call-quota guard for ASP.NET Core services. The verifier accepts an identity only after re-posting the entire received query to Steam with openid.mode=check_authentication and getting is_valid:true, AND matching the claimed_id against the one legal steamcommunity identity form. The Web API client keeps absence and failure distinct: a private profile returns an empty list, a throttle or non-success status throws. The quota guard enforces a daily budget under Steam's 100,000 calls/day ToS ceiling and resets at UTC midnight.",
